<section id="how" class="wrap sec" aria-labelledby="h-why">
  <h2 id="h-why" class="h2" data-reveal="up">Everything between the estimate and the final bill</h2>
  <p class="lead" data-reveal="up">For remodelers and handymen with 1 to 9 people, who write estimates in the truck and get asked for extras halfway through the job.</p>
  <ul class="grid" data-reveal="stagger">
    <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h11M4 18h7"/></svg><h3>One-sentence estimates</h3><p>Describe the job the way you’d say it. We draft line items from your saved prices, and you check every one.</p></li>
    <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 20l4-1L19 8l-3-3L5 16z"/><path d="M14 7l3 3"/></svg><h3>Change orders on the spot</h3><p>What changes, the price up or down, any extra days and up to three photos, written in the kitchen.</p></li>
    <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="7" y="3" width="10" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M11 18h2"/></svg><h3>Signed on your phone</h3><p>Hand them the phone, or text a link from your own messages. They sign with a finger. No app for them.</p></li>
    <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17 5H7l5 7-5 7h10"/></svg><h3>A running total</h3><p>Each change joins the job total the moment it’s signed, so you always know what the job is worth.</p></li>
    <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 3h7l4 4v14H7z"/><path d="M14 3v4h4"/></svg><h3>A record you both keep</h3><p>Each signed PDF shows the typed name, the time, the device and a fingerprint of the exact document.</p></li>
    <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 18L18 6"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="7.5" r="2"/><circle cx="16.5" cy="16.5" r="2"/></svg><h3>Tax, deposit and your logo</h3><p>Set them once. They show up on every estimate, change order and PDF.</p></li>
    <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4v11M7 10l5 5 5-5M5 20h14"/></svg><h3>Export whenever you like</h3><p>Download any signed PDF, or every job as a CSV. Your records stay yours.</p></li>
    <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M8 11V8a4 4 0 0 1 7.5-2"/></svg><h3>Never locked out</h3><p>If you stop paying, your account turns read-only and you can still download everything.</p></li>
  </ul>
</section>

